{
  "$comment": [
    "Built-in scheduled agentic-workflow digest.",
    "This hourly workflow pulse runs as its own process and uses the selected delivery transport",
    "in-process -- never through an MCP client session, which has a restricted",
    "tool set and a bounded lifetime.",
    "",
    "No email address lives in this file. 'account' optionally names a standby",
    "email alias in config/google-accounts.profile.json, used only if",
    "owner-delivery selects email; when absent (the shipped default) this",
    "falls back to that profile's own defaultAccount.",
    "",
    "grid: 7 days x 48 half-hour slots, host-local. Each cell is 'digest' (full",
    "read), 'pulse' (compact hourly update), or absent (off). A slot fires at",
    "most once, is marked fired BEFORE generation, and only within the bounded",
    "grace window in src/lib/agent-digest/schedule.js."
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "enabled": true,
  "tickSeconds": 30,
  "generationTimeoutMs": 300000,
  "grid": {
    "mon": {
      "08:00": "digest", "09:00": "pulse", "10:00": "pulse", "11:00": "pulse", "12:00": "pulse",
      "13:00": "pulse", "14:00": "pulse", "15:00": "pulse", "16:00": "pulse", "17:00": "pulse",
      "18:00": "pulse", "19:00": "pulse", "21:00": "pulse", "22:00": "digest"
    },
    "tue": {
      "08:00": "digest", "09:00": "pulse", "10:00": "pulse", "11:00": "pulse", "12:00": "pulse",
      "13:00": "pulse", "14:00": "pulse", "15:00": "pulse", "16:00": "pulse", "17:00": "pulse",
      "18:00": "pulse", "19:00": "pulse", "21:00": "pulse", "22:00": "digest"
    },
    "wed": {
      "08:00": "digest", "09:00": "pulse", "10:00": "pulse", "11:00": "pulse", "12:00": "pulse",
      "13:00": "pulse", "14:00": "pulse", "15:00": "pulse", "16:00": "pulse", "17:00": "pulse",
      "18:00": "pulse", "19:00": "pulse", "21:00": "pulse", "22:00": "digest"
    },
    "thu": {
